Actual population growth would depend on participation, mortality, migration, and subsequent generations.

Section 5. Freedom of Family Planning.

This order establishes a demographic goal, not a mandate to reproduce. No American shall be forced to marry, conceive, carry a pregnancy, or have a specified number of children. Family planning remains voluntary.

Section 6. Implementation.

The administration shall submit a ten-year feasibility study evaluating the costs, benefits, and practical requirements of a voluntary Ten-Child Family Initiative.

Section 7. Effective Date.

This proposal takes effect as a policy vision upon publication, subject to applicable law and any necessary congressional authorization.

